{"name":"You are here - GPS for any map","dev":"Matteo Martin","keys":["ios:1546267246"],"ios":{"id":"1546267246","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/you-are-here-gps-for-any-map/id1546267246?uo=4","rating":0,"ratings":0,"price":"Free","genre":"Navigation","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/eb/a3/87/eba387b5-e63a-4cff-c4d3-746254a69077/75287c51-96ab-4600-b5f7-e04b6a86faed_Simulator_Screen_Shot_-_iPhone_8_Plus_-_2020-12-29_at_02.14.58.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/60/31/51/603151a4-2e80-fc99-89d1-714772dffc3d/3b2fd538-7013-4bc7-86a0-f744d8799371_Simulator_Screen_Shot_-_iPhone_8_Plus_-_2020-12-29_at_02.13.31.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource124/v4/31/63/63/316363bc-4cec-0e14-392b-49961a9df622/ea65bcb1-ac8a-489e-8737-8671430663d3_Simulator_Screen_Shot_-_iPhone_8_Plus_-_2020-12-29_at_02.10.47.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/c5/6c/89/c56c89f4-8aea-feba-b1bb-83759ee89005/e4164461-a980-4531-b317-cf199c907f5d_Simulator_Screen_Shot_-_iPhone_8_Plus_-_2020-12-29_at_02.12.35.png/392x696bb.png","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource114/v4/7b/01/4f/7b014f2d-b3da-6dd3-2960-d6186be6cb44/5c861213-3fdf-4956-9865-071beae5783e_Simulator_Screen_Shot_-_iPhone_8_Plus_-_2020-12-29_at_02.13.04.png/392x696bb.png"],"desc":"During hiking it’s easy to get lost, even when you have a map. You don’t always know where you are on it!\n\nWith You Are Here, take a picture of your map or load an existing one. Then, indicate where are located 2 points of this map. Validate. You now see your GPS location on the map you chose!\n\nIt works with any type of map (hiking, biking, touristic map, bus…)\n\nFeatures:\n- Show your GPS location in real time\n- Works with almost every map\n- Don’t need an Internet connection once your map has been added","released":"2021-01-03","updated":"2021-01-07","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzs